I hit her a couple of times. I then received it to squeeze her neck. Until she stopped re-regulating on the floor. And as for Caleb, I snuck out in the middle of the night. I also had no idea. I laughed at one there. I caught her to his house. She seemed to go up to the bedroom.

58
00:46:56.000 --> 00:47:50.000
I hit him in the chest and when he brought me up, we began to struggle. I threw him into the shelving unit beside his bed. He tried to bribe me with money. I didn't speak to him. I just knocked him to the ground and I proceeded to choke him. Chris told detectives. I'm telling you right now that Melissa Merritt did not know anything until after it was done. The detectives were unconvinced. They placed Chris and Melissa in a room alone together and listened in as the couple started whispering. Chris revealed that he had confessed to Bridget and Caleb's murders in a panic. He told Melissa that he wanted to kill him.

